tengine/godot/issues/118110","id":6142046779,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABbhgyOw","user":{"login":"Robert-K","id":34353377,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MzUzMzc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34353377?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K","html_url":"https://github.com/Robert-K","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-13T09:00:11Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:00:11Z","body":"It seems this bug might've been reintroduced somewhere in 4.8... our sky shader/image-based-lighting breaks as soon as there's TIME in the shader, but it's really inconsistent and hard to reproduce. I was unable to reproduce it with the MRP.\nWe're on a custom fork that's based on 4.8dev7.\nFunnily enough, one Environment configuration that's apparently still cached from 4.7 does actually work.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6142046779/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6146278325","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118110#issuecomment-6146278325","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118110","id":6146278325,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABbljDtQ","user":{"login":"TokisanGames","id":632766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/632766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames","html_url":"https://github.com/TokisanGames","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-13T13:08:55Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:13:06Z","body":"@Robert-K I would recommend looking at the multiple links into the Godot source in this ticket and the attached PR, then looking for all changes to those files in Godot between 4.7 and main. Perhaps that can clue us into commits that reintroduced the issue. Once you can reproduce it with an MRP, using git bisect can help pinpoint the exact commit. \n\n(nevermind my removed comments, they were irrelevant)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6146278325/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]